LXG - Run Desktop Apps on LXC Containers

Usage:

  lxg help / --help / -h
  lxg listen [ARGS...]
  lxg setup [CONTAINER] [ARGS...]
  lxg start [CONTAINER] [ARGS...]
  lxg stop [CONTAINER] [ARGS...]
  lxg run [CONTAINER] [ARGS...]

  lxg container setup [ARGS...]
  lxg container init [ARGS...]
  lxg container request [COMMAND] [ARGS...]

Commands:

  help       Print this help message

Host Commands:

  listen     Start the host integration socket (bridge)
  setup      Configure LXG support on host and container
  start      Start container from host
  stop       Stop container from host
  run        Run command on container from host

Container Commands:

  setup      Configure internal LXG support on container
  init       Initialize LXG environment support
  request    Request command execution on host via bridge
